--- inline handler with $value
patched: c2
<div class="card" data-nv="c2">
    <h2>Card for world</h2>
    
        <p>slotted, last hit: hey!</p>
    
</div>
--- a component with two roots, inline toggle
patched: c6
<nv-c data-nv="c6" style="display:contents"><dt data-nv-click="[&quot;c6&quot;,&quot;nvInline1&quot;,[],&quot;&quot;]">toggle</dt><dd class=" open">shown</dd></nv-c>
--- a handler that fails: the view survives, the error is reported
web: error in Fragile (call explode): array index 3 out of bounds (size 0)
patched: 
error: array index 3 out of bounds (size 0)
--- navigate
patched: 
go: /elsewhere
--- a render that fails
web: error in Page (render): array index 1 out of bounds (size 1)
patched: 
error: array index 1 out of bounds (size 1)
